    {
      "source": "For more information on the underlying SBERT framework, see:\n<a href=\"https://www.sbert.net/index.html\">SBERT Documentation</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.sbert.net/docs/pretrained_models.html\">SBERT Pre-trained\nModels</a>",
      "translation": "有关底层 SBERT 框架的更多信息，请参阅：\n<a href=\"https://www.sbert.net/index.html\">SBERT 文档</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.sbert.net/docs/pretrained_models.html\">SBERT 预训练模型</a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, it uses the all-MiniLM-L6-v2 model, but can be configured to use other\nONNX-compatible models. The class supports both CPU and GPU inference, caching of model\nresources, and various tokenization options.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，它使用 all-MiniLM-L6-v2 模型，但可以配置为使用其他兼容 ONNX 的模型。该类支持 CPU 和 GPU 推理、模型资源缓存以及多种分词选项。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Extracts the text content from a <a href=\"../document/Document.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.document\"><code>Document</code></a> to be used for embedding. By\ndefault, returns <a href=\"../document/Document.html#getText()\"><code>Document.getText()</code></a>. Implementations that support\n<a href=\"../document/MetadataMode.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.ai.document\"><code>MetadataMode</code></a> should override this method to\nreturn\n<a href=\"../document/Document.html#getFormattedContent(org.springframework.ai.document.MetadataMode)\"><code>Document.getFormattedContent(org.springframework.ai.document.MetadataMode)</code></a>\nwith the appropriate metadata mode, so that metadata is included in the text sent\nto the embedding API.",
      "translation": "从 <a href=\"../document/Document.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.document\"><code>Document</code></a> 中提取用于嵌入的文本内容。默认情况下，返回 <a href=\"../document/Document.html#getText()\"><code>Document.getText()</code></a>。支持 <a href=\"../document/MetadataMode.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.ai.document\"><code>MetadataMode</code></a> 的实现应重写此方法，以返回\n<a href=\"../document/Document.html#getFormattedContent(org.springframework.ai.document.MetadataMode)\"><code>Document.getFormattedContent(org.springframework.ai.document.MetadataMode)</code></a>\n并传入适当的元数据模式，以便将元数据包含在发送到嵌入 API 的文本中。",
      "count": 1
    },
